# Feature lifecycle

New or risky features require documentation touch (not necessarily new governance files).

## Minimum doc touch

| Item | Where |
|------|--------|
| Current vs Target behavior | Canonical policy or ROADMAP |
| Rollout / phase | `docs/ROADMAP.md` |
| Governance impact | relevant `docs/governance/*.md` or ENFORCEMENT_MATRIX row |
| Audit impact | PROVENANCE / AI_POLICY if LLM |
| Shipped note | `docs/PROJECT_LOG.md` |

## Dangerous features (default)

- Feature flag, default **OFF**
- Kill-switch path documented
- Rollback per `docs/governance/ROLLBACK_POLICY.md`
- No change to pipeline semantics without explicit user request

## Skills

- Governance review: `.cursor/skills/governance-alignment/SKILL.md`
- Phase A guards: `.cursor/skills/runtime-alignment-change/SKILL.md`
- Flagged rollout: `.cursor/skills/feature-flagged-change/SKILL.md`
